        "collapsible_tab_Qz7EyW": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Shilajit Himalayan Honey Blend?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Only natural supplement rich in Fulvic Acid and trace minerals with Himalayan Honey. </li><li>\"Destroyer of Weakness\" in Ayurveda - trusted by healers for over 3,000 years.</li><li>6 x higher mineral density than most other natural supplements.</li><li>Compounds that boost clarity, focus, and cognition that rejuvenate both body and mind.</li><li>Perfect taste with naturally sweetened and enhanced Shilajit potency.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_nXt8Qr": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Fulvic Acid & Trace Minerals with Himalayan Honey",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Our Himalayan Shilajit Honey Blend delivers balanced fulvic acid and 85+ essential trace minerals from pure shilajit while the natural enzymes, antioxidants, and beneficial compounds of Himalayan honey from Nepal. </p><p> </p><p>Perfect for daily vitality, fulvic acid enhances nutrient absorption at the cellular level while the himalayan honey provides natural enzymes that support digestion and metabolism. The trace minerals restore balance and support energy, while honey natural sugars provide continuous energy. Each serving of 4-5 drops (0.2ml) gives pure shilajit enhanced with Himalayan honey natural properties. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_YpH44X": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Active Ingredients: Pure Himalayan Shilajit & Himalayan Honey from Nepal</li><li>Container: 100ml 3.39 OZ - 500 servings (based on 4-5 drop serving)</li><li>Each serving provides 0.2ml of Shilajit-honey blend.</li><li>Convenient for 6+ months daily use at the recommended dose (once daily) or 4+ months with twice daily use.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_cizB8F": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Use",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Take 1 heaped teaspoon each morning. Enjoy straight or supercharge your morning beverage or breakfast. Due to the lower GI (slower release) of, you can also use it throughout the day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Note: To get the most out of the bioactives in, take daily on an empty stomach and avoid adding it to boiling water (hot is okay).</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
