      "settings": {
        "show_schema": false,
        "heading": "What's in Shilajit Honey Blend?",
        "description": "<p>\nA Shilajit Himalayan Honey Blend brings together two Himalayan powerhouses in one extraordinary formula. First, the Himalayan Honey is from mountains that are mountain-rich in bioactive compounds, and has a very strong and distinctive taste. Next is pure Himalayan Shilajit, a resinous mineral-laden material full of fulvic acid as well as dozens of trace minerals that are purified carefully to maintain its potency.\n</p>\n<p>\nThis combination is an unusual mix of two Himalayan supplements- powerful, energizing and unique. It provides the short-term natural vitality of mad honey as well as the long-term mineral tonifier of shilajit. Ideal for those who desire a wellness- bold, synergistic, boost in flavor, natural and steeped in ancient tradition.\n</p>",
