        "heading_size": "h2",
        "section_title": "",
        "section_description": "<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0673/4063/2201/files/Picture__Mad_Honey_Shilajit.webp?v=1758883518\">\n<p>This rare fusion of Himalayan Honey and Natural Shilajit creates a nutrient-dense blend that supports energy, stamina, and focus with a rich, exotic taste unique to the Himalayas.\n</p>",
