          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 1 - 2",
            "slide_heading": "Begin to experience increased energy and focus.",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>\nThe Shilajit Himalayan Honey Blend provides sustained energy through both Shilajit's mineral support and Himalayan honey's natural sugars. During the initial weeks, you'll feel a balanced boost in energy and endurance with improved mental clarity and reduced fatigue.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nResults can vary based on factors like lifestyle and consistency. While many experience benefits quickly, individual results may vary. For best outcomes, regular use alongside a healthy routine is recommended.\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        "slide_VUR3wa": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 3 - 10",
            "slide_heading": "Feel a noticeable difference in overall wellness.",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>\nDuring this stage, fulvic acid boosts nutrient absorption and cellular energy while honey's enzymes enhance digestion. Dibenzo-α-pyrones support stamina and recovery through their antioxidant effects. The 85+ trace minerals help balance the body, improving mood and daily performance. You'll feel more resilient, energetic, and mentally refreshed.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nResults can vary based on factors like lifestyle and consistency. While many experience benefits quickly, individual results may vary. For best outcomes, regular use alongside a healthy routine is recommended.\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        "slide_8E6BHW": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 11+",
            "slide_heading": "Enhanced vitality, resilience, and mental clarity.",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>\nBy now, the synergistic effects of Shilajit and Himalayan honey have fully taken hold, supporting deeper energy, focus, and recovery. The combined fulvic acid and natural enzymes work consistently to maintain balance, stamina, and digestive health. You feel more resilient, mentally sharp, and energized throughout the day.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nResults can vary based on factors like lifestyle and consistency. While many experience benefits quickly, individual results may vary. For best outcomes, regular use alongside a healthy routine is recommended.\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        }
      },
